From: Mathias Fiedler <mathias_fiedler@mentor.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2015 14:34:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 15/23] gstomxvideodec: initialize intersection caps

Prevents potential crash at trying to unref uninitialized object.
---
 omx/gstomxvideodec.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/omx/gstomxvideodec.c b/omx/gstomxvideodec.c
index 9dbe733..a5c3cc6 100644
--- a/omx/gstomxvideodec.c
+++ b/omx/gstomxvideodec.c
@@ -1825,7 +1825,7 @@ gst_omx_video_dec_negotiate (GstOMXVideoDec * self)
   OMX_ERRORTYPE err;
   GstCaps *comp_supported_caps;
   GList *negotiation_map = NULL, *l;
-  GstCaps *templ_caps, *intersection;
+  GstCaps *templ_caps, *intersection = NULL;
   GstVideoFormat format;
   GstStructure *s;
   const gchar *format_str;
